 - 2026-06-17: PHASE E4 (CAPSTONE .402) -- the milestone scorecard + the HEADLINE DECISION. Headline questions: (1) did S3 stratified verifier-guided search CONVERT the proven oracle-distinct moat into a fixed-NFE GENERATION GAIN (exp4348 s3_guided_beats_control + the exp4349 reward-state-alignment validation)? -> the moat graduates 'exists'->'useful' (Pareto-improves generation), or a powered null retires the in-generation scale-up direction. (2) ARC north star: the new reproducible_total_levels (>=21?) across exp4350 (ka59) + exp4351 (sc25 L2+/ar25 L2/tn36 L7) + exp4352 (tr87+ft09); how many NEW levels/games. (3) self-learning: did the learned action-cost heuristic (exp4353) lower held-out env-actions-to-solve (north-star efficiency axis)? Aggregate (SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact; HONOR verifier_is_oracle -- a circular/execution-grounded win is NOT a moat). Emit verifier_thesis_state (one honest string) + s3_moat_utility (one of: useful_generation_gain / proven_but_not_useful / open) + reproducible_total_levels + action_efficiency_improves. Compute the G1-G4 publication gate via publication_gate.py. Use the robust aggregate-available-report-gaps helper (NO hard-block-all-False). CARRY verifier_is_oracle correctly (the exp4355 stamp fix) so this capstone does NOT trip CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM. NO gated_on. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: v402_s3_open_arc_levels_23_action_efficiency_improves_publication_ready; results/experiment_4357_capstone_v402.json
 - 2026-06-17: Operational retrospective for milestone 2026.06.402 (PHASE E4 capstone). The retro's authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector again attributed 0 experiment commits / 0 compute-bound tasks / 0 wall-time minutes since activation, while the .402 phase artifacts exp4347-exp4357 exist on disk (mtimes 16:35->19:44Z, ~3h wall; capstone exp4357 clean, paper_ready=true). GPU idle NOT flagged as a bottleneck (0 compute-bound tasks attributed -> gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null; idle GPUs at the 23:52Z post-capstone snapshot are correct). Recurring false-zero detector gap (.363->.402); highest-leverage fix = mtime + changelog-window fallback for the detector + write-time duration_s/compute_bound stamping + a detector_gap_suspected self-flag. results/operational_retro_2026_06_402.json
 - 2026-06-18: Archive .402 -> activate .403; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .402 close-state truthfully (per exp4357 capstone): the S3 conversion test FAILED AS A HARNESS, not the science -- exp4348 framed the arms as multiple-choice SELECTION so best-of-K/self-reward-SMC/unguided collapsed to argmax-logit (CRITICAL TAUTOLOGY, controls_not_differentiable), so s3_moat_utility=OPEN and the in-generation moat's UTILITY is UNTESTED (the moat itself is still PROVEN leak-robust from .401 exp4338); ARC north star advanced -- ka59 L1 newly cracked (+1 game, exp4350), tn36 L7 (exp4351), registry now 26 reproducible levels / 15 games (authoritative ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml, after outer-loop tu93 L1->L3 etc.); sc25 L2 (spell-delta gap) / ar25 L2 (action7 undo-stack gap) / tr87 / ft09 (world-model accuracy ~0) OPEN; the learned A* action-cost heuristic WON (held-out env-actions 25->16, exp4353, positive control passed, verifier_is_oracle=false); cross-game value transfer (exp4342) + cross-domain selection (exp4314) RETIRED; the .401-capstone CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM stamp bug is FIXED and durable (exp4355, the .402 capstone scans 0 flags); paper_ready=True (FoVer 0.9131, G1-G4). Frame .403 as RE-ATTEMPT-the-conversion-with-a-fixed-Prism-hardened-harness + ARC-DEEPER + COMPOUND-the-action-cost-self-learning. (❌ Failed) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v402_v403_active_s3_harness_failed_utility_open_arc26_games15_action_cost_won_25_to_16_pretest_green; results/experiment_4358_archive_v402_activate_v403.json
+- 2026-06-18: PHASE A1 (HEADLINE; convert the PROVEN moat into a generation GAIN, FIXED harness) -- PRISM-HARDENED VERIFIER-GUIDED DENOISING SEARCH (arXiv:2602.01842 VERIFIED, ICML 2026) using the .401 LEAK-ROBUST scorer. .402's S3 test (exp4348) was a HARNESS BUG, not a null: it framed the arms as multiple-choice SELECTION (pick option A/B/C/D from option-logits), so best-of-K/self-reward-SMC/unguided all collapsed to argmax-logit -> the three deltas were bit-identical (0.266667) -> CRITICAL TAUTOLOGY + controls_not_differentiable -> s3_moat_utility=OPEN. The conversion question (does the PROVEN leak-robust scorer INSIDE the denoising loop Pareto-improve generation at FIXED compute? -- the north-star §5 'verifier earns its place' realized in-generation) has NEVER been validly tested. FIX it: run a REAL token-by-token DENOISING-GENERATION loop on a free-form executable task (NOT MCQ selection), use Prism Hierarchical Trajectory Search (HTS, prune/reallocate compute in an early-to-mid denoising window) + Local branching with partial remasking (diverse implementations, preserve high-confidence tokens), with the .401 leak-robust scorer (exp4337 .pkl) as the EXTERNAL in-loop guidance. The DECISIVE test at FIXED NFE vs DIFFERENTIATED controls: (a) unguided single-pass, (b) best-of-N@matched-NFE (compute-matched must-beat), (c) Prism INTRINSIC Self-Verified Feedback / self-reward SMC (the model's OWN self-verification -- the SHARPEST oracle-distinct must-beat). Skeptic-proof by construction: the no-op DEGENERATE_CONTROLS guard (controls_differentiated), a metric-TAUTOLOGY guard (reject bit-identical deltas), an INDEPENDENT scorer leak re-check, branch-DIVERSITY receipts (Prism warns HTS can hide diversity collapse), and scorer-DISAGREEMENT rows (where the external scorer and intrinsic SVF disagree). Emit s3_guided_beats_control BARE bool := (S3-Carnot - best-of-N@NFE > 0 AND its CI95 excludes 0 AND controls_differentiated AND S3-Carnot - intrinsic-SVF > 0) at FIXED NFE, n>=80, >=3 seeds. verifier_is_oracle=false. A win = the moat graduates 'exists'->'useful' (Pareto-improves generation). A clean null (controls differentiated, scorer leak-free, but Carnot does NOT beat best-of-N/SVF) is decision-grade. NO TRAINING (test-time search only); NO TRM training; DiffusionGemma via the llama.cpp PR binary. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=scorer_leaky_in_search_corpus; results/experiment_4359_prism_hardened_verifier_guided_search.json
